(
    title: "Daffy Duck: The Marvin Missions",
    developer: Some("Sunsoft"),
    description: Some("Marvin the Martian means to blow up the Earth, so Daffy straps on a jet pack and an unlimited ray gun and sets out across four stages. Shoot enemies or land on them; shoot the ringing alarm clocks to open sealed passages; ride a moving platform through flying sections, walls ahead and Marvin\'s fire behind. Bosses shrug off the gun and have to be jumped on."),
